'''Sound of Wings''' (パタパタ, ''Pata Pata'', '''Flap Flap''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]].

==Effect==
Cat Cannon Recharge UP (Sm): Cat Cannon will charge 10 seconds faster.

==Combo==
{{Combos
|{{CatCombo|Sound of Wings|Cannon Recharge Up (Sm)|Cupid Cat|Bird Cat|jpname=パタパタ}}
}}

==Trivia==
*This combo's Japanese name is the onomatopoeia for the sound of flapping wings.

